  📗
    An app whose routes take the fields of 🧬🐇🔬🔸🧬 two ways each: bound by
    the shape the route was given (/shaped for a body, /asked for a query),
    and read by a handler that calls the readers itself (/written and
    /queried). Each answers what it read. /both takes a body and a query by
    two shapes, /unshaped binds by a shape it was not given, and /odd asks
    what was read for things the shape does not have.
